# Supabase local
supabase/.branches/
supabase/.temp/
# Unanchored: the CLI writes .temp/ relative to wherever it was invoked, which is not
# always the repo root — a stray copy under src/ once slipped past the anchored form.
**/supabase/.branches/
**/supabase/.temp/
